build.prompt:
Build {{input.file}} from docs/doc-outline.md.
Style: {{input.style}}
Audience: {{input.audience}}

<brief>
{{input.brief}}
</brief>

Render every page and fix what you see until render reports no problems. Then export the PDF (render with export: "pdf").

review.prompt:
Review {{input.file}} against the brief and docs/doc-outline.md. Render and look at every page. Write docs/doc-review.md.

<brief>
{{input.brief}}
</brief>
Audience: {{input.audience}}

revise.prompt:
Address every BLOCKING and MAJOR finding in docs/doc-review.md in the build script; re-run, render every changed page to confirm, export the PDF again. Add a "Resolution" line under each finding you fixed.

Review summary:
{{state.review}}
